OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F169A1788456255
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing hails 'unprecedented' Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry exhibition in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King said he was the direct
OL,7,Fdescendant of one of the key figures in
OL,8,Fthe tapestry, William, Duke of
OL,9,FNormandy, whose army invaded and
OL,10,Fdefeated King Harold at the Battle of
OL,11,FHastings in 1066.
OL,13,FThe tapestry "tells the story of the
OL,14,Fbeginning of what I like to think of as
OL,15,Fthe French side of my family's history
OL,16,Fin these islands", he added.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
